      "title": "Oozora Subaru (1st costume)",
      "excerpt": "The default costume of [[hololive]]'s [[Oozora Subaru]].\r\n\r\nIt consists of an [[oversized shirt|oversized]] [[loose shirt|loose]], [[short sleeves|short-sleeved]] [[two-tone shirt|two-tone]] [[white shirt|white]] and [[yellow shirt|yellow]] [[vertical-striped shirt|vertical-striped]] [[t-shirt]] with the hemline [[long shirt|reaching her hips]] and [[tied shirt|tied]] on the side, a [[two-tone headwear|two-tone]] ([[white hat|white]] and [[red hat|red]]) [[baseball cap]], which she usually wears [[backwards hat|backwards]], [[white shorts]], a [[wristband|wrist]] [[sweatband]], [[white shorts]], [[mismatched legwear|mismatched]] [[red thighhighs|red]] and [[white thighhighs]] and [[white shoes|white]] [[sneakers]]. Being a sports club manager she also carries a [[whistle around neck|whistle]] and a [[stopwatch around neck|stopwatch on her neck]] a [[megaphone]] and a small yellow [[towel]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #7804987: Profile\r\n* !post #3443258: Reference sheet",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    },
